      <p>This is the result of 2 weeks wandering around Japan.</p>
      <div class="not-prose mt-[1.25em]">
        <Item size="xs" className="rounded bg-slate-50">
          <ItemMedia>
            <HeadphonesIcon className="mt-px size-4 text-slate-600" />
          </ItemMedia>
          <ItemContent>
            <ItemTitle className="text-slate-700"
              >Japan is a country full of sounds</ItemTitle
            >
            <ItemDescription className="ml-px line-clamp-none text-slate-500"
